{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42075","headline":"思湓渚旧居 · 李中","name":"思湓渚旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔岁曾居湓水头，草堂吟啸兴何幽。\n迎僧常踏竹间藓，爱月独登溪上楼。\n寒翠入檐岚岫晓，冷声萦枕野泉秋。\n从拘宦路无由到，昨夜分明梦去游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}